**What I changed:**

- **Fix (No.1):** the rulebook says acceptance-check results go in the "証跡" chapter, with the check date, environment, an identifier and pass/fail. The sample had the mock-run instruction under "手順適用範囲・前提" and recorded only "the result". I moved the paragraph to "証跡". It now also records the check date, environment, procedure checked, `ticket_id` and pass/fail.
- **Kept:** the rest of the sample already had what the rulebook requires and nothing it doesn't need. That covers the overview stating it is a subset of `opr-index`, the alert flow (confirm → temporary fix → permanent fix) and false-alarm handling. It also covers the evidence table and the reason given for each chapter that defers to `opr-index`.

